-Yes, sir. I'm so excited.

00:05:47.501 --> 00:05:49.400
-What do you do when you
do these giant things...

00:05:49.400 --> 00:05:51.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:51.434 --> 00:05:53.267
You have these giant tours.

00:05:53.267 --> 00:05:55.467
What do you do to calm --
Do you, like, go into a room

00:05:55.467 --> 00:05:57.434
