[ Breathes deeply ]

00:05:57.434 --> 00:05:58.634
"Don Juan," you know?

00:05:58.634 --> 00:05:59.968
And just like,
"Everyone, leave me alone."

00:05:59.968 --> 00:06:02.400
Do you light candles?
What do you do to de-stress?

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:04.868
-Bro, I would say
that I don't have any ritual,

00:06:04.868 --> 00:06:07.133
but talking to my family.

00:06:07.133 --> 00:06:09.267
You know, like,
it gives me peace.

00:06:09.267 --> 00:06:11.167
You know,
also meditating a little bit

00:06:11.167 --> 00:06:13.968
