5 or 10 minutes.

00:06:13.968 --> 00:06:15.601
-Did you always talk
to your family -- always?

00:06:15.601 --> 00:06:17.501
-Yeah.
They're now here, actually.

00:06:17.501 --> 00:06:19.300
