-They did?

00:06:19.300 --> 00:06:20.968
-My parents, yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:20.968 --> 00:06:24.000
Yeah, that's nice.
My whole family came here.

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:26.133
-No way. My dad came to
the show the other night.

00:06:26.133 --> 00:06:27.567
It was our first show back.
-Oh, really?

00:06:27.567 --> 00:06:29.234
-My dad surprised me,
yeah, and he came to the show.

00:06:29.234 --> 00:06:31.501
-How beautiful is that, right?
-It's the greatest.

00:06:31.501 --> 00:06:34.634
-It feels great to perform
and see your family there, man.

00:06:34.634 --> 00:06:36.501
You know, like,
sometimes, I feel like

00:06:36.501 --> 00:06:38.033
