you come on the show.

00:08:01.234 --> 00:08:04.367
But this album
has 25 tracks on it.

00:08:04.367 --> 00:08:06.367
-Yeah.
-That's a lot of music.

00:08:06.367 --> 00:08:08.767
-Yeah, because I've been
saving a bunch of music

00:08:08.767 --> 00:08:11.434
and I didn't want to just
keep it in my files, you know,

00:08:11.434 --> 00:08:12.701
