00:08:12.701 --> 00:08:14.667
And I know that there are,
like, good songs

00:08:14.667 --> 00:08:16.200
that deserve to be out.

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:18.534
You know, fans deserve
to have those songs.

00:08:18.534 --> 00:08:20.701
So I just didn't want
to keep them with me

00:08:20.701 --> 00:08:22.367
and I shared them all, you know?

00:08:22.367 --> 00:08:23.968
-But it just came out,
I would say,

00:08:23.968 --> 00:08:25.367
at the end of August, maybe,
and then --

00:08:25.367 --> 00:08:28.100
-Just a month. Yeah.
-Over a billion streams, buddy.

00:08:28.100 --> 00:08:30.601
-Yeah, bro.
Thank you. Thank you.

00:08:30.601 --> 00:08:31.734
-Come on!
-Thank you.

00:08:31.734 --> 00:08:34.667
-You are crushing it.
-Thank you, bro.

00:08:34.667 --> 00:08:39.234
-And your new song,
"Según Quién."

00:08:39.234 --> 00:08:41.501
-"Según Quién."
-"Según Quién."

00:08:41.501 --> 00:08:43.868
-Yes, sir.
-Which means...

00:08:43.868 --> 00:08:45.067
-Guess who. Oh, no, no.

00:08:45.067 --> 00:08:47.801
-No, it means
"according to whom?"

