-You wish.
You wish I was crying over you.

00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:58.734
-You want to see me cry.
-You want to see me cry?

00:08:58.734 --> 00:09:00.667
According to whom?
-You won't see me crying.

00:09:00.667 --> 00:09:02.000
-You're not gonna see me.

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:03.334
-I'm better without you,
