00:09:03.334 --> 00:09:05.801
-Exactly. That's another one.
That's right.

00:09:05.801 --> 00:09:08.167
"I'm better without you."
That's our first duet?

00:09:08.167 --> 00:09:09.667
-Please, but don't do it
over the cover.

00:09:09.667 --> 00:09:10.934
-No, no, no. Over here. No.

00:09:10.934 --> 00:09:14.033
I'm going to put it
on my lower back.

00:09:14.033 --> 00:09:17.501
"Don Jimmy
is better without you."

00:09:17.501 --> 00:09:20.968
That's the name of our duet.
-First track. "Don Jimmy."

00:09:20.968 --> 00:09:22.133
-You're pointing at me.

00:09:22.133 --> 00:09:23.567
You said,
"It's better without you."

00:09:23.567 --> 00:09:26.667
[ Laughter ]

00:09:26.667 --> 00:09:29.667
-Bro, that was a good one.
-Right?

00:09:29.667 --> 00:09:31.767
-"That's better without you."
That's the cover.

00:09:31.767 --> 00:09:33.033
-It's the cover.
You're looking at me.

00:09:33.033 --> 00:09:34.300
You're like, "Yeah,
the song is better without you."

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:36.868
Yeah, I'll take it.
But you know what made me laugh?

00:09:36.868 --> 00:09:40.300
You know, there's a giant
TikTok trend for your song,

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:42.901
and it's because that beat
comes in and goes, "Go, go, go!"

00:09:42.901 --> 00:09:44.667
-Boom, boom, boom, boom.
-Yeah.

00:09:44.667 --> 00:09:47.133
-And did you start it?

00:09:47.133 --> 00:09:48.968
-No, man. Like, this was so fun.

00:09:48.968 --> 00:09:50.601
Like, I went into TikTok --

00:09:50.601 --> 00:09:53.567
You know, I don't use TikTok
that often, to be honest.

00:09:53.567 --> 00:09:55.834
Like, I just like
to put my content there,

00:09:55.834 --> 00:09:58.267
but I don't like to be there
all the time,

00:09:58.267 --> 00:09:59.634
because, you know, I spend

00:09:59.634 --> 00:10:02.934
a lot of time also on Instagram
and all the social media.

00:10:02.934 --> 00:10:05.868
So, one day, I was talking
to my team, and they were like,

00:10:05.868 --> 00:10:08.133
"Yo, did you see
what the fans are doing

00:10:08.133 --> 00:10:10.467
with the song,
with 'Según Quién'?"

00:10:10.467 --> 00:10:11.634
And I had no idea.

00:10:11.634 --> 00:10:13.501
So I went straight to TikTok
and I saw a girl,

00:10:13.501 --> 00:10:15.434
and this girl was doing
something with her hands.

00:10:15.434 --> 00:10:17.467
And I was like, "I don't get it.

00:10:17.467 --> 00:10:19.968
Like, Is that a trend
or something?

00:10:19.968 --> 00:10:21.100
Is that a challenge?"

00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:23.167
"Yeah, all these kids
are doing it."

00:10:23.167 --> 00:10:24.234
So I started doing it.

00:10:24.234 --> 00:10:27.634
And then, right now, on TikTok,

00:10:27.634 --> 00:10:30.601
the video has already like
40 million views, man.

00:10:30.601 --> 00:10:32.133
-No, everyone's doing it
'cause they're doing it

00:10:32.133 --> 00:10:34.434
because they're just going like,
"Hey, I don't cry.

00:10:34.434 --> 00:10:35.801
Who told you that I cried?"

00:10:35.801 --> 00:10:38.601
And she goes, knock
and then backwards knock,

00:10:38.601 --> 00:10:40.934
but a finger is lifted,
but it's not this finger.

00:10:40.934 --> 00:10:43.067
-This one.
-It's not that one either.

00:10:43.067 --> 00:10:46.734
It's everything --
every other finger but that one.

00:10:46.734 --> 00:10:49.367
[ Laughter ]

00:10:49.367 --> 00:10:51.868
It's every -- I'm sorry.

00:10:51.868 --> 00:10:53.901
I get so silly when
you're on the show every time.

00:10:53.901 --> 00:10:56.501
But it goes one, two, three...

00:10:56.501 --> 00:10:59.367
-Boom. Yeah.
-And it is really fun.

00:10:59.367 --> 00:11:02.300
If you just check out --
Search for Maluma on TikTok.

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:03.467
It is the thing
that's trending right now.

00:11:03.467 --> 00:11:05.067
And you're doing
that song for us tonight.

00:11:05.067 --> 00:11:06.567
Who produced that track,
by the way?

00:11:06.567 --> 00:11:09.868
-Edgar Barrera and Keityn --
Mexico and Colombia.

00:11:09.868 --> 00:11:12.367
These guys, they are Latinos
and they're killing the game,

00:11:12.367 --> 00:11:13.601
so shout-out to Keityn, Edgar.

00:11:13.601 --> 00:11:16.567
-That is a great sound.
It is a different sound.

00:11:16.567 --> 00:11:18.934
It's so good.
-The whole crew, guys.

00:11:18.934 --> 00:11:20.400
-Congratulations on this.
-Thank you.

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:22.934
-You're singing for us later.
You know I love you, buddy.

00:11:22.934 --> 00:11:24.434
And break a leg
at the Garden tomorrow.

00:11:24.434 --> 00:11:26.167
-Thank you.
-Maluma!

00:11:26.167 --> 00:11:27.834
"Don Juan" is available now.

00:11:27.834 --> 00:11:30.067
He'll be performing
for us later in the show.

00:11:30.067 --> 00:11:32.434
Hayley Williams joins us
after the break.

00:11:32.434 --> 00:11:35.267
Stick around. Come on back.
♪♪

